  "bodyHash": "8958e5f6e78a924f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>凝灰岩傀儡雕像 ⚜️</h1>\n<p><strong>本模組</strong>&nbsp;為《我的世界》新增了<strong>凝灰岩傀儡雕像與凝灰岩石</strong>，分佈於<strong>主世界各生態域</strong>中，為<strong>原版遊戲</strong>帶來更豐富的氛圍，並以<strong>致敬形式</strong>讓凝灰岩傀儡重返遊戲！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b473d4eeb7b48a57fd28bb74e953e5689f01e87.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡宣傳圖\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp &copy; - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>注意事項📝 (備註)</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tuff Golem Statues</strong>&nbsp;與<strong>1.20 至 1.21.10</strong>版本<strong>相容</strong>🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>Tuff Golem Statues</strong>&nbsp;會將新的雕像<strong>（結構）</strong>新增至世界生成中🌐</li>\n<li><strong>Tuff Golem Statues</strong>&nbsp;與任何<strong>世界生成模組</strong>皆相容</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>解壓已下載的檔案 🗂️</li>\n<li>建議<strong>使用耳機</strong>以獲得<strong>更佳體驗</strong>&nbsp;🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>模組介紹 🎼 (描述)</h2>\n<p>在更具沉浸感的原版《我的世界》中盡情享受，<strong>為凝灰岩傀儡新增致敬結構</strong>，為主世界及其所有生態域帶來<strong>獨特且多樣的特色</strong>🌎。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/902562d27098b1f455b90fd9d47ec6e736ef1e07.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡宣傳圖\"></p>\n<p>透過此<strong>模組</strong>，探索之旅 🧭 變得更加精彩，並以雕像形式讓曾在<strong>生物投票</strong>中落敗的<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>重返遊戲。</p>\n<h2>生成機制🌐 (生成)</h2>\n<p><strong>每個生態域</strong>&nbsp;都有獨特的凝灰岩生成規則，依生態域不同而有所差異。以下為各生態域與其對應的<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>範例：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩石</p>\n<p>🪨&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩石</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_rock</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0d30f8445e074d0dd3875058f760c0dd6c80cf51.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩石\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:#is_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 紅色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/78d531297579e4fc69f640a0ee20f322999ba971.png\" alt=\"紅色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該紅色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_red</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d950859550cfbe9cd6b1441aac72db623abcd7c9.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（紅）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 粉紅色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b8ed0ed31a42bc2b9d390873152c0c75b6764a61.png\" alt=\"粉紅色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該粉紅色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_pink</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻桃樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01232d94f583b2dad68a3cf9c9be4db87854eea8.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（粉紅）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻桃樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:cherry_grove\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 黑色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2a41e4f8ffd4fdeb0c91f17e326fece16484894.png\" alt=\"黑色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該黑色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_black</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"金合歡樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0e35b4658101905f32b141f2edebafd363e7025c.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（黑）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"金合歡樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:savanna_plateau\",\n\n\"minecraft:savanna\",\n\n\"minecraft:windswept_savanna\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 淺灰色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/64f572b33a5b5a0a2dbcf39fdf2786153f6b4fb4.png\" alt=\"淺灰色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該淺灰色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_light_gray</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae16232d7922799f34a22e292e72e58e498848f3.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（淺灰）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:pale_garden\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 棕色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/edca32f592054c3c5ed2fefa92bd15c06a9291ba.png\" alt=\"棕色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該棕色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_brown</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b1aa9433f6c385506d287e16f362375a0c1d31.png\" alt=\"叢林樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dacdf25c8ebc5478868452aa147d0