\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 青綠色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c4145fcd1686b59699a5376a07c83b282de6a8f.png\" alt=\"青綠色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該青綠色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_lime</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51698357a71e0449eb71dd43ce35f29a8eeaafff.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（青綠）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:plains\"\n\n\"minecraft:forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 藍色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a2e98ba76179772464a6cf062d416dd6fdbccca.png\" alt=\"藍色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該藍色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_blue</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e8add1cd34b1c0271f2005f430cb9ce23456c09d.png\" alt=\"矢車菊\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fabd5ba4da11886561f4f143d8502ac067219488.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（藍）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e8add1cd34b1c0271f2005f430cb9ce23456c09d.png\" alt=\"矢車菊\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:jagged_peaks\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 青色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eaa459267163f3e73b969d883e3c0cdb2d5d4f5e.png\" alt=\"青色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該青色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_cyan</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40734e67350a5a3a8ef693cc05fd12482747cf8c.png\" alt=\"藍蘭花\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7beec945b990f992fa865cabd5b66cb1002b8063.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（青）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40734e67350a5a3a8ef693cc05fd12482747cf8c.png\" alt=\"藍蘭花\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:snowy_taiga\"\n\n\"minecraft:snowy_slopes\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 淺藍色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/79dda2e0c2b4a382b5646bdb2de5e71ff42d6dc7.png\" alt=\"淺藍色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該淺藍色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_light_blue</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e9a79db68fce3cce974fdc9069eed9b98597259.png\" alt=\"雪球\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/902562d27098b1f455b90fd9d47ec6e736ef1e07.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（淺藍）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e9a79db68fce3cce974fdc9069eed9b98597259.png\" alt=\"雪球\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:frozen_peaks\"\n\n\"minecraft:ice_spikes\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 白色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/520861db413af77dee12cefbaad4e11416fe5581.png\" alt=\"白色束包物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，該白色雕像變體為<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_white</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c6ae94b18cd9f4f456df62ab76d6cd454b342b7.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（白）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺樹幼苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:birch_forest\"\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_birch_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>粗面傀儡 - 橘色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/266a978f61a0d7038180ee0764448fc1a45f4407.png\" alt=\"橘色束口袋物品\">&nbsp;<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>，橘色雕像變體擁有<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_orange</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e1d4584d5472b0eaf3ede0a8e6312f0921e856.png\" alt=\"枯灌木物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f7cd441529fe13f2f1213a9dc12660ffe98bd39.jpeg\" alt=\"粗面傀儡 橘色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e1d4584d5472b0eaf3ede0a8e6312f0921e856.png\" alt=\"枯灌木物品\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:wooded_badlands\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>粗面傀儡 - 黃色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f2d5266cfb84df1ff8bd3f6e856a0e74bc17c3e.png\" alt=\"黃色束口袋物品\">&nbsp;<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>，黃色雕像變體擁有<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_yellow</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f54a625568f9a358f2062013c85d9c676cdc9be.png\" alt=\"高乾草物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/13564f94ae5e509cb98a132027aa15ce81453e0b.jpeg\" alt=\"粗面傀儡 黃色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f54a625568f9a358f2062013c85d9c676cdc9be.png\" alt=\"高乾草物品\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:desert\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>粗面傀儡 - 洋紅色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/34fd93ce4920972a886e902ffe456c2ad36219dc.png\" alt=\"洋紅色束口袋物品\">&nbsp;<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>，洋紅色雕像變體擁有<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_magenta</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b73ca081d395eb3bfebd49fdf94ef87cc5e8ceb6.png\" alt=\"丁香花物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb0854bca37fb097fa1035c9748d17f59617ee4c.jpeg\" alt=\"粗面傀儡 洋紅色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b73ca081d395eb3bfebd49fdf94ef87cc5e8ceb6.png\" alt=\"丁香花物品\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:flower_forest\"\n\n\"minecraft:meadow\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>粗面傀儡 - 灰色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d815b05d1fea15f9b57d613ac247b429cbe6ee1e.png\" alt=\"灰色束口袋物品\">&nbsp;<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>，灰色雕像變體擁有<strong>稀有稀有度</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_gray</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8100ab22a7e7bdc543e2d3b239725ff5762d6814.png\" alt=\"棕色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7a2f56d9729ed03d2c0172f92070629715124d9.jpeg\" alt=\"粗面傀儡 灰色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7cd1020ed8f6ab949346acf099e8d8827d9303.png\" alt=\"紅色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:mushroom_fields\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>粗面傀儡 - 三重雕像</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae0bf0d042b3174771fef77c4a81196f5f236415.png\" alt=\"束口袋物品\">&nbsp;<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>，三重雕像變體擁有<strong>罕見稀有度</strong>，結合三種顏色，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_triple</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/005307a32ef556a08001a7e866db2bdb636a9f1d.png\" alt=\"杜鵑花樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17545e4264a94ff73c4c40f97cd70a595ff35df1.jpeg\" alt=\"粗面傀儡 三重\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/005307a32ef556a08001a7e866db2bdb636a9f1d.png\" alt=\"杜鵑花樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_pine_taiga\"\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_spruce_taiga\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新增成就 🏆（新進階）</h2>\n<p>在主世界中找到所有<strong>粗面傀儡</strong>的變體將解鎖一組新的「找到所有顏色」<strong>成就</strong>，而找到<strong>全部 17 種粗面傀儡變體</strong>將解鎖一個隱藏<strong>進階</strong>，名為「<strong>雕像收藏集</strong>」，顯示如下：</p>\n<p>◾ <strong>圖片 (Image) <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d27c3d64d2c9cf14b4494937edfc09f03068279e.png\" alt=\"地圖物品\">：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d00684089a3ef1c428eb86f489c8f43765be540c.png\" alt=\"粗面傀儡成就\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
